    "sections": {
        "description": "AC Repair Solutions is designed for service providers who want a clear and practical website to connect with customers. It helps present repair services, service areas, and contact details in a straightforward way so visitors can quickly understand what you offer and how to reach you. The layout is simple and organized, making it easy to guide users toward booking or inquiries without confusion. It also works smoothly across different screen sizes, ensuring a consistent experience for users on mobile and desktop. This theme focuses on ease of use and reliability. You can set up your website quickly, manage content without hassle, and keep everything updated as your business grows. It loads efficiently and supports essential features like service listings and contact forms without adding unnecessary complexity. Whether you are starting out or improving your existing site, it provides a practical foundation to present your services clearly and build trust with your audience."
    },
